1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,220
My dad only used his phone to make calls.

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:09,870
One day I said: "Dad, ask the AI something."

3
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:14,480
He laughed: "I'm too old for these things."

4
00:00:15,210 --> 00:00:19,940
I taught him just one thing: to ask by voice.

5
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:25,350
His first question: "Why are my tomato leaves turning yellow?"

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,200
The AI answered.

7
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:31,910
Dad put on his glasses and read it carefully.

8
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:39,360
A week later he called me: "Son, I asked the AI for a fairy tale for my granddaughter!"

9
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:43,050
Now he learns something new every day.

10
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:46,110
And yesterday he gave me a lesson.

11
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:50,100
Technology doesn't ask your age.

12
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,880
It only waits for the first step.

13
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:58,450
What would you teach your parents?

